@host = http://127.0.0.1:50052

### Opret en bog
POST {{host}}/org.example.book.BookService/createBook/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
tri-protocol-version: 1

{
	"name": "Min første bog",
	"authorId": "1",
	"publisherId": "1",
	"publicationYear": 2026
}

### Hent en bog via ID
POST {{host}}/org.example.book.BookService/getBookById/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
tri-protocol-version: 1

{
	"bookId": "1"
}
